  "effectiveDate": "2025-02-28",
  "historyNote": "#9963, eff 7-28-11; ss by #12827, INTERIM, eff 7-20-19, EXPIRED: 1-16-20 New. #12985, eff 1-29-20; ss by #14206, eff 2-28-25 -(formerly He-P 811.16)",
